OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FInitial rain
OL,6,Fwill clear towards midnight, leaving a
OL,7,Fdrier interlude with a few clear
OL,8,Fspells. Further cloud and outbreaks of
OL,9,Frain will then develop early Thursday
OL,10,Fmorning. Winds easing.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FGenerally cloudy with a few
OL,13,Fshowers to start the day, sunny spells
OL,14,Fsoon developing however and becoming
OL,15,Flargely dry by the afternoon. Light
OL,16,Fwinds. Rain arriving later in the
OL,17,Fevening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
